    "title": "Katie Hobbs' reported running mate John Giles dropped GOP registration months before pick - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By DAVID IVERSEN ,\n13 hours ago Former Mesa Mayor John Giles quietly changed his voter registration from Republican to no party preference in May, months before he was reportedly tapped by Hobbs as a running mate. Maricopa County voter records obtained through a public records request show Giles filed the change on May 17, checking “Other”... Read full article\n3",
